<title>UK: Oz Holding sets put warrants on UBS. [CORRECTED 16:35 GMT]</title>
<headline>Oz Holding sets put warrants on UBS. [CORRECTED 16:35 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oz Holding Zurich said it has issued 2.5 million (corrects from 250,000) put warrants on bearer shares of Union Bank of Switzerland.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 10 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,150 CHF		 ISSUE PRICE  8.30 CHF</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   17.OCT.97		 PAYDATE	22.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 10</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1,169 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
